Chapter 0 about logic, set theory and proof writing;
Chapter 2 §1 about sequences and limits of sequences, as well as all subsequent results about limits of sequences; §5 about rigorous (epsilon-) definitions of limit of sequence and limit of function (proofs of results about limits can only be done based on these rigorous definitions);
Chapter 3 about derivative
Chapter 4 about applying the Mean Value Theorem.
Content taught after midterm(Ch3&4) is harder.

